/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(self), microphone=(), geolocation=(self)
  # Report-only first: stampdd.club deploys as a PWA (service worker +
  # Google/Cloudflare third-party scripts) and a hard CSP in one shot would
  # be an outage gamble. CSP-Report-Only reports violations to the API's
  # /api/csp-report collector without blocking anything; once the collected
  # violations show the policy is right, promote it to Content-Security-Policy.
  # Edit origins to match the actual deployment before promoting:
  #   - connect-src needs the API origin (VITE_API_BASE_URL)
  #   - img-src needs the API origin + stampdd.club if avatars are hosted there
  #
  # Every directive below must describe an origin the app ACTUALLY loads from.
  # A report-only policy that doesn't still costs real time: each violation is
  # its own POST to report-uri, issued during page load, same-origin as the
  # document — so a wrong policy turns one page load into ~40-100 extra
  # requests contending with the app's own. The three origins called out here
  # were each measured producing violations on a live /explore load:
  #   - font-src: src/styles/fonts.css @imports Google Fonts, whose woff2
  #     files are served from fonts.gstatic.com (26 violations on one load)
  #   - style-src: that same @import fetches the stylesheet from
  #     fonts.googleapis.com, and Google Sign-In injects accounts.google.com/gsi/style
  #   - frame-src: Google Sign-In renders an accounts.google.com iframe. It was
  #     absent entirely, so it fell back to default-src 'self' and violated on
  #     every render.
  # See docs/bug/2026-08-14-stale-sw-and-csp-report-storm.md.
  Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' https://accounts.google.com https://*.googleapis.com 'unsafe-inline' https://*.google-analytics.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://accounts.google.com https://fonts.googleapis.com; img-src 'self' data: https:; font-src 'self' data: https://fonts.gstatic.com; connect-src 'self' https://accounts.google.com https://www.google-analytics.com https://*.googleapis.com https://api.stampdd.club; frame-src 'self' https://accounts.google.com; worker-src 'self'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self' https://accounts.google.com; frame-ancestors 'none'; report-uri /api/csp-report
